INE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">◈ 접수인원 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">200명(선착순)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">◈ 특강일시 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">2009년 9월 24일(목) 14:00~16:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">◈ 특강장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">글로벌관 시청각실(GB109호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">◈ 강&nbsp;&nbsp; 사 : 홍성안(한국과학기술연구원 책임연구원)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">◈ 내&nbsp;&nbsp; 용 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 에너지 현황 및 이슈</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수소경제와 연료전지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연구개발 동향 및 산업화 전망</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">참여학생 인정인 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #008000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">10시간 이상의 센터 프로그램 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #008000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">참여 시간에 포함</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">됨</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">2009. 9. 21</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
